  "description": "As a child, Hwa-Rim accidentally unleashed an ancient serpent spirit that has hunted her ever since. Protected by her late grandmother's shamanic legacy, she spends years in hiding until the spirit possesses a classmate to track her down. Now, with an innocent life at stake and nowhere left to run, Hwa-Rim must confront the evil that has haunted her family before she becomes its next vessel.\n\n(Source: WEBTOON))\n\n*Note: This series serves as a prequel to the 2024 film Exhuma (파묘).*",
